 takes  the dog off her by rubbing him with the  dog repellent at the hospital they tell  the parents that the girl will have to  go to therapy to regain the mobility of  the arm at that moment the neighbors  arrive so fabiola gets angry and  complains about the damage that the dog  caused to her daughter but the neighbors  say that the girl attacked the dog first  and that the repellent also hurt him so  it begins a great discussion that leads  nowhere then rod contacts an old friend  who is a lawyer to help him get rid of  the animal but the lawyer gets  authorization to euthanize the dog this  makes her think about whether what he  did was right or wrong that night  there's a blackout in the house and the  next day when the technician repaired it  he told them that the incident could  have been caused the couple then goes to  ask a neighbor if they notice something  strange at night and he tells them that  he saw anna in their house that night so  the couple complains to these neighbors  chava who is at home apologizes for what  happened saying that his wife anna has  not been feeling very well lately and  also tells them that they are going to  move soon  however when they return home roy  realizes that someone has blown the  tires of his car at night the family  begins to hear strange noises outside so  roy decides to go take a look leaving  fabiola and the girl at home royce  starts looking everywhere until he  reaches the neighbor's house meanwhile  fibial answers the phone and the lawyer  tells fabiola that the neighbors are  actually using false names so they must  be careful with them then fabiol decides  to take a knife and take her daughter to  a different room roy keeps looking at  the neighbor's house in the dark when  suddenly he sees the neighbor with a dog  mask he stabs roy in the knee causing  him to full tibial was locked in the  room with her daughter when suddenly  someone tries to enter but she defends  herself by stabbing the stranger's hand 