in that the dog suffered then roy asks  sava ten tie him just to have a drink  and he agrees however roy manages to  start a fire and burn chavez's face in  response chava turns on the shocking  machine and shocks roy to death at that  moment on arrives with the girl and  looks at everything that happened so she  begins to scold chava for having killed  roy because she wanted the couple to  suffer first when they saw the girl die  anna goes to heal chava in another room  and fabiola takes the opportunity to  tell her daughter to untie her at that  moment on arrives and fabiola hits her  with a bottle knocking her down tibial  takes her daughter to a room to hide  while chavez discovers what they did to  his wife when he sees his wife on the  ground chava takes a knife and goes in  search of fabiola and the girl but when  he finds them fabiola defends herself  with a hook sticking it in his neck  fabial and the girl were about to leave  the house the fabiola decides to return  to finish killing chava who was bleeding  on the floor  when she was coming back to the car she  realizes that anna was no longer on the  ground so she gets scared and run to  look for her daughter but she and the  vehicle were no longer there  we later see the fabiola contacted the  police but they couldn't find her  daughter let me see on in a new place  with a new appearance who treats the  girl as if she were a dog locked inside  her house the end  if you liked the video please leave a  like and subscribe to continue receiving  the recaps of the best horror movies my  name is tc and i'll see you in the next  video bye

